  "deviations": [
    "No padding-global or container: the grid is full bleed (1600 of 1600) and the header and captions sit 2.5rem in from the tile edge, not 2rem, so they carry their own offsets.",
    "Caption bottom offset is 2.5rem on every tile; Figma has 2rem on the first full-width tile and 2.5rem on the others.",
    "Figure placeholder colour #D9D9D9 is a literal value (no variable); it only shows until images are set.",
    "Tile heights use aspect-ratio (1600 / 995 wide, 8 / 9 half) so the mosaic scales with viewport width; at 1440 the section is about 2602px tall against 2892px at the 1600 Figma frame.",
    "Below 768px the grid stacks to one column (wide tiles 4 / 5, half tiles 1 / 1). Figma has no mobile frame for this section.",
    "Q018 build (2026-10-20): the five combos the class stacks need did not exist, so this session created them empty with Stephen's approval: .gallery-mosaic-captioned_heading.heading-style-h4, .gallery-mosaic-captioned_heading.heading-style-h4.text-weight-normal, .gallery-mosaic-captioned_feature-title.heading-style-h2, .gallery-mosaic-captioned_feature-title.heading-style-h2.text-weight-normal, .gallery-mosaic-captioned_caption.text-style-caps-caption-16.",
    "Q018 build: the plan's visibility props are boolean props (Show Heading, default on; Show Feature Title, default off) bound to the visibility setting of the header and feature header, because create_prop has no visibility type.",
    "Q018 build: the images carry no explicit loading=lazy attribute; Webflow images load lazily by default, and a reserved attribute name would reject the whole builder call.",
    "Q018 build: image props have no default asset (the plan has no asset ids), so all four tiles show the Webflow placeholder image over the #D9D9D9 figure background.",
    "Q018 build: component is named 'Gallery Mosaic Captioned' (Title Case, matching Q012 to Q014) and prop display names are Title Case (Heading, Show Heading, Feature Title, Show Feature Title, Image 1 to 4, Caption 1 to 4)."
